{"model": "mtp_like", "subset": "icc_backchannel", "task": "backchannel", "sid": "27", "mode": "decision", "duration_s": 62.005, "end_time": 70.056, "gt_user_speech_s": 61.1, "spoke": true, "formal_turn_by_audio": true, "first_speech_start": 12.744, "audible_within_input": true, "speech_beyond_input_s": 0, "speech_intervals": [[12.744, 13.159], [15.996, 51.144], [59.336, 70.056]], "n_turns": 14, "n_decisions": 69, "compute_s": 26.543, "max_decision_s": 2.152, "tts_compute_s": 62.848, "stt_s": 0.644, "stt_partial_s": 0.461, "stt_final_s": 0.183, "stt_calls": 101, "floor_compute_s": 1.1438, "yield_compute_s": 0.0587, "asr_settle_latency_s": 0.3000000000000007, "barge_ins": [{"speech_onset": 13.1, "stop_at": 13.159, "reaction_s": 0.059, "played_before_stop_s": 0.356, "would_have_played_s": 11.12, "asr_settle_s": 0.3}, {"speech_onset": 20.1, "stop_at": 30.716, "reaction_s": 0.06, "flush_before_playback": true}, {"speech_onset": 20.8, "stop_at": 21.415, "reaction_s": 0.06, "flush_before_playback": true}, {"speech_onset": 31.6, "stop_at": 46.804, "reaction_s": 0.065, "flush_before_playback": true}, {"speech_onset": 33.1, "stop_at": 33.611, "reaction_s": 0.062, "flush_before_playback": true}, {"speech_onset": 35.3, "stop_at": 36.003, "reaction_s": 0.086, "flush_before_playback": true}, {"speech_onset": 47.0, "stop_at": 53.581, "reaction_s": 0.109, "flush_before_playback": true}, {"speech_onset": 50.9, "stop_at": 51.144, "reaction_s": 0.244, "flush_before_playback": true}, {"speech_onset": 56.8, "stop_at": 57.319, "reaction_s": 0.477, "flush_before_playback": true}], "utt_finalized": 22, "utt_skipped": {"digital_silence": 1}, "audio_beyond_input_s": 8.051, "tts_capped": 2, "tts_capped_words": 21, "paused_floor_take": null, "interrupt_span": null, "post_interrupt_text": "", "took_floor_after_interrupt": false, "tags": ["user_is_speaking:empty", "user_is_speaking:empty", "user_is_speaking:empty", "user_is_speaking:empty", "user_is_speaking:empty", "user_is_speaking:empty", "user_is_speaking:empty", "user_is_speaking:empty", "user_is_speaking:empty", "user_is_speaking:empty", "user_is_speaking:empty", "user_is_speaking:empty", "user_finish_speaking", "user_is_speaking:empty", "user_is_speaking:empty", "user_finish_speaking", "user_is_speaking:empty", "user_finish_speaking", "user_is_speaking:empty", "user_is_speaking:empty", "user_is_speaking:empty", "user_is_speaking:empty", "user_finish_speaking", "no_tag:empty", "user_is_speaking:empty", "user_is_speaking:empty", "user_is_speaking:empty", "user_is_speaking:empty", "user_is_speaking:empty", "user_finish_speaking", "user_is_speaking:empty", "user_finish_speaking", "user_finish_speaking", "user_is_speaking:empty", "user_is_speaking:empty", "user_finish_speaking", "user_is_speaking:empty", "user_is_speaking:empty", "user_finish_speaking", "user_interruption:empty", "user_is_speaking:empty", "user_is_speaking:empty", "user_is_speaking:empty", "user_is_speaking:empty", "user_is_speaking:empty", "user_is_speaking:empty", "user_is_speaking:empty", "user_finish_speaking", "user_is_speaking:empty", "user_is_speaking:empty", "user_is_speaking:empty", "user_is_speaking:empty", "user_finish_speaking", "user_is_speaking:empty", "user_is_speaking:empty", "user_is_speaking:empty", "user_finish_speaking", "user_is_speaking:empty", "user_is_speaking:empty", "user_is_speaking:empty", "user_is_speaking:empty", "user_finish_speaking", "user_is_speaking:empty", "user_finish_speaking", "user_is_speaking:empty", "user_finish_speaking", "user_finish_speaking:inaudible", "user_is_speaking:empty", "user_finish_speaking", "user_finish_speaking:inaudible", "user_is_speaking:empty"], "turns": [{"start": 12.744, "end": 13.159, "natural_end": 23.864, "dur": 0.415, "text": "Ah, entendeu! Ficamos perdidos na encosta, não sabíamos onde ela terminava... E quando finalmente chegamos, foi só um momento com os amigos — tipo, \"finalmente chegamos, e", "tag": "user_finish_speaking", "kind": "speech", "n_words": 27, "stopped": true}, {"start": 15.996, "end": 30.716, "natural_end": 30.716, "dur": 14.72, "text": "Ah, tá! Eles estavam atrás de nós todo o tempo... Finalmente chegamos, mas a gente só percebeu depois. 😅<|im_end|>", "tag": "user_finish_speaking", "kind": "speech", "n_words": 19, "stopped": false}, {"start": 30.716, "end": 30.716, "natural_end": 45.116, "dur": 0.0, "text": "Tá... e o pai deles levava eles todo o tempo. Tipo, sempre atrás, sempre no mesmo lugar. 😅<|im_end|>", "tag": "user_finish_speaking", "kind": "speech", "n_words": 18, "stopped": true}, {"start": 21.415, "end": 21.415, "natural_end": 35.415, "dur": 0.0, "text": "20 semanas... e eles ficaram muito envolvidos, como se fosse uma rotina. Tipo, sempre lá, sempre no mesmo ritmo. 😅<|im_end|>", "tag": "user_finish_speaking", "kind": "speech", "n_words": 20, "stopped": true}, {"start": 28.644, "end": 38.084, "natural_end": 38.084, "dur": 9.44, "text": "Tá! Foi o ano dos Olímpicos de Inverno, e aí começou a esquiar — e os amigos ficaram totalmente envolvidos. Tipo, a cada semana era mais forte a conexão", "tag": "user_finish_speaking", "kind": "speech", "n_words": 29, "stopped": false}, {"start": 38.084, "end": 46.804, "natural_end": 46.804, "dur": 8.72, "text": "É por isso que ficou tão marcado. 😊<|im_end|>", "tag": "user_finish_speaking", "kind": "speech", "n_words": 8, "stopped": false}, {"start": 46.804, "end": 46.804, "natural_end": 47.124, "dur": 0.0, "text": "Eles ficaram... no meio do esquiar, do tempo, do ritmo. 😊<|im_end|>", "tag": "user_finish_speaking", "kind": "speech", "n_words": 11, "stopped": true}, {"start": 33.611, "end": 33.611, "natural_end": 47.691, "dur": 0.0, "text": "Bom de esquiar porque achavam que era muito legal — e aí o prazer começou a crescer. 😊<|im_end|>", "tag": "user_finish_speaking", "kind": "speech", "n_words": 18, "stopped": true}, {"start": 36.003, "end": 36.003, "natural_end": 51.603, "dur": 0.0, "text": "Tipo: \"Legal, descer, sentir o vento, o gelo, o mundo passar rápido!\" 😄<|im_end|>", "tag": "user_finish_speaking", "kind": "speech", "n_words": 13, "stopped": true}, {"start": 43.501, "end": 53.581, "natural_end": 53.581, "dur": 10.08, "text": "E aí eu só era tipo... \"Ok, vou tentar\" — e quando desci, fui: *uau, isso é tão divertido!* 😍<|im_end|>", "tag": "user_finish_speaking", "kind": "speech", "n_words": 20, "stopped": false}, {"start": 53.581, "end": 53.581, "natural_end": 61.901, "dur": 0.0, "text": "Tinha medo, sim — mas quando viu que eles amavam, só pensou: \"Eles realmente amam isso. E eu também, só que de forma diferente.\" 😊<|im_end|>", "tag": "user_finish_speaking", "kind": "speech", "n_words": 25, "stopped": true}, {"start": 51.112, "end": 51.144, "natural_end": 66.792, "dur": 0.032, "text": "Porque já estava de pular e não podíiamos voltar... Tinha que seguir, mesmo com medo. E foi assim que o momento ficou eterno. 😅<|im_end|>", "tag": "user_finish_speaking", "kind": "speech", "n_words": 24, "stopped": true}, {"start": 57.319, "end": 57.319, "natural_end": 63.079, "dur": 0.0, "text": "Alô! Esse foi o fato que fez tipo pizza, depois francês e a linha literalmente paralela... Tudo isso no mesmo dia. 😂🍕🇫🇷<|im_end|>", "tag": "user_finish_speaking", "kind": "speech", "n_words": 22, "stopped": true}, {"start": 59.336, "end": 70.056, "natural_end": 70.056, "dur": 10.72, "text": "Ela nem penteia... Eu não vou. Eu não vou. 😅<|im_end|>", "tag": "user_finish_speaking", "kind": "speech", "n_words": 10, "stopped": false}], "user_pieces": [{"kind": "partial", "text": "A gente não conseguia ver", "t_start": 1.52, "t_end": 2.64, "t_avail": 3.2, "ends_turn": false, "utt": 0}, {"kind": "partial", "text": "pra onde", "t_start": 2.62, "t_end": 2.96, "t_avail": 3.8000000000000003, "ends_turn": false, "utt": 0}, {"kind": "partial", "text": "a encosta continuava, tipo ela só", "t_start": 2.96, "t_end": 4.48, "t_avail": 5.2, "ends_turn": false, "utt": 0}, {"kind": "final", "text": "ia ir e era tipo...", "t_start": 4.48, "t_end": 5.58, "t_avail": 5.6000000000000005, "ends_turn": true, "utt": 0}, {"kind": "silence", "text": "<|no voice|>", "t_start": 6.6000000000000005, "t_end": 6.6000000000000005, "t_avail": 6.6000000000000005, "ends_turn": false, "utt": 0}, {"kind": "final", "text": "Fora! Oh!", "t_start": 6.32, "t_end": 6.6000000000000005, "t_avail": 6.800000000000001, "ends_turn": true, "utt": 1}, {"kind": "partial", "text": "Finalmente a gente", "t_start": 7.160000000000001, "t_end": 7.620000000000001, "t_avail": 8.200000000000001, "ends_turn": false, "utt": 2}, {"kind": "partial", "text": "chegou e a gente", "t_start": 7.620000000000001, "t_end": 8.18, "t_avail": 9.0, "ends_turn": false, "utt": 2}, {"kind": "partial", "text": "tava com esses amigos", "t_start": 8.18, "t_end": 8.940000000000001, "t_avail": 9.600000000000001, "ends_turn": false, "utt": 2}, {"kind": "partial", "text": "que...", "t_start": 8.940000000000001, "t_end": 9.56, "t_avail": 10.4, "ends_turn": false, "utt": 2}, {"kind": "final", "text": "Chegou. Por um...", "t_start": 9.58, "t_end": 10.58, "t_avail": 10.600000000000001, "ends_turn": true, "utt": 2}, {"kind": "silence", "text": "<|no voice|>", "t_start": 11.4, "t_end": 11.4, "t_avail": 11.4, "ends_turn": false, "utt": 0}, {"kind": "final", "text": "tempo.", "t_start": 10.600000000000001, "t_end": 10.88, "t_avail": 11.600000000000001, "ends_turn": true, "utt": 3}, {"kind": "silence", "text": "<|no voice|>", "t_start": 12.200000000000001, "t_end": 12.200000000000001, "t_avail": 12.200000000000001, "ends_turn": false, "utt": 0}, {"kind": "final", "text": "tipo eles", "t_start": 11.810000000000002, "t_end": 12.930000000000001, "t_avail": 13.4, "ends_turn": true, "utt": 4}, {"kind": "partial", "text": "que é atrás de nós.", "t_start": 13.4, "t_end": 14.34, "t_avail": 15.0, "ends_turn": false, "utt": 5}, {"kind": "final", "text": "mas...", "t_start": 15.0, "t_end": 15.18, "t_avail": 15.200000000000001, "ends_turn": true, "utt": 5}, {"kind": "partial", "text": "o pai deles levava eles tipo todo.", "t_start": 15.200000000000001, "t_end": 16.52, "t_avail": 17.400000000000002, "ends_turn": false, "utt": 6}, {"kind": "partial", "text": "20 semanas", "t_start": 16.62, "t_end": 17.0, "t_avail": 18.2, "ends_turn": false, "utt": 6}, {"kind": "partial", "text": "as vezes eles ficaram tipo muito envolvidos", "t_start": 17.1, "t_end": 18.380000000000003, "t_avail": 19.400000000000002, "ends_turn": false, "utt": 6}, {"kind": "partial", "text": "com isso", "t_start": 18.380000000000003, "t_end": 18.78, "t_avail": 19.400000000000002, "ends_turn": false, "utt": 6}, {"kind": "partial", "text": "e também", "t_start": 18.78, "t_end": 19.380000000000003, "t_avail": 20.200000000000003, "ends_turn": false, "utt": 6}, {"kind": "final", "text": "foi.", "t_start": 19.380000000000003, "t_end": 19.96, "t_avail": 20.400000000000002, "ends_turn": true, "utt": 6}, {"kind": "final", "text": "", "t_start": 21.200000000000003, "t_end": 21.200000000000003, "t_avail": 21.200000000000003, "ends_turn": true, "utt": 7}, {"kind": "partial", "text": "e começar a esquiar, foi o ano", "t_start": 21.200000000000003, "t_end": 22.26, "t_avail": 23.200000000000003, "ends_turn": false, "utt": 8}, {"kind": "partial", "text": "do", "t_start": 22.26, "t_end": 22.42, "t_avail": 23.200000000000003, "ends_turn": false, "utt": 8}, {"kind": "partial", "text": "um dos anos dos", "t_start": 22.980000000000004, "t_end": 23.940000000000005, "t_avail": 24.6, "ends_turn": false, "utt": 8}, {"kind": "partial", "text": "olímpicos de", "t_start": 23.940000000000005, "t_end": 24.6, "t_avail": 25.200000000000003, "ends_turn": false, "utt": 8}, {"kind": "partial", "text": "de inverno, então eles ficaram tão envolvidos", "t_start": 24.42, "t_end": 26.000000000000004, "t_avail": 26.6, "ends_turn": false, "utt": 8}, {"kind": "partial", "text": "com isso.", "t_start": 26.000000000000004, "t_end": 26.46, "t_avail": 27.200000000000003, "ends_turn": false, "utt": 8}, {"kind": "silence", "text": "<|no voice|>", "t_start": 28.0, "t_end": 28.0, "t_avail": 28.0, "ends_turn": false, "utt": 0}, {"kind": "partial", "text": "É por isso.", "t_start": 26.720000000000002, "t_end": 27.140000000000004, "t_avail": 28.0, "ends_turn": false, "utt": 8}, {"kind": "final", "text": "eles ficaram.", "t_start": 27.26, "t_end": 27.980000000000004, "t_avail": 28.200000000000003, "ends_turn": true, "utt": 8}, {"kind": "partial", "text": "Bom de esquiar porque achavam que era", "t_start": 28.200000000000003, "t_end": 30.520000000000003, "t_avail": 31.6, "ends_turn": false, "utt": 9}, {"kind": "partial", "text": "muito", "t_start": 30.520000000000003, "t_end": 30.860000000000003, "t_avail": 31.6, "ends_turn": false, "utt": 9}, {"kind": "final", "text": "legal, assim, então tinha.", "t_start": 30.860000000000003, "t_end": 32.580000000000005, "t_avail": 32.6, "ends_turn": true, "utt": 9}, {"kind": "final", "text": "Tipo? Legal, tipo...", "t_start": 32.6, "t_end": 33.58, "t_avail": 33.6, "ends_turn": true, "utt": 10}, {"kind": "silence", "text": "<|no voice|>", "t_start": 34.800000000000004, "t_end": 34.800000000000004, "t_avail": 34.800000000000004, "ends_turn": false, "utt": 0}, {"kind": "final", "text": "descer.", "t_start": 33.6, "t_end": 34.2, "t_avail": 35.0, "ends_turn": true, "utt": 11}, {"kind": "partial", "text": "E aí eu", "t_start": 35.0, "t_end": 35.9, "t_avail": 36.800000000000004, "ends_turn": false, "utt": 12}, {"kind": "silence", "text": "<|no voice|>", "t_start": 37.2, "t_end": 37.2, "t_avail": 37.2, "ends_turn": false, "utt": 0}, {"kind": "final", "text": "só era tipo...", "t_start": 35.88, "t_end": 36.98, "t_avail": 37.4, "ends_turn": true, "utt": 12}, {"kind": "silence", "text": "<|no voice|>", "t_start": 38.0, "t_end": 38.0, "t_avail": 38.0, "ends_turn": false, "utt": 0}, {"kind": "silence", "text": "<|no voice|>", "t_start": 38.6, "t_end": 38.6, "t_avail": 38.6, "ends_turn": false, "utt": 0}, {"kind": "partial", "text": "Ok, aí eu", "t_start": 39.19, "t_end": 39.79, "t_avail": 40.400000000000006, "ends_turn": false, "utt": 13}, {"kind": "partial", "text": "faço", "t_start": 39.81, "t_end": 39.989999999999995, "t_avail": 41.2, "ends_turn": false, "utt": 13}, {"kind": "partial", "text": "e eu era tipo", "t_start": 40.01, "t_end": 40.55, "t_avail": 41.800000000000004, "ends_turn": false, "utt": 13}, {"kind": "final", "text": "uau, isso é tão divertido.", "t_start": 40.71, "t_end": 41.87, "t_avail": 42.400000000000006, "ends_turn": true, "utt": 13}, {"kind": "partial", "text": "Eu estava só muito", "t_start": 42.400000000000006, "t_end": 43.10000000000001, "t_avail": 43.800000000000004, "ends_turn": false, "utt": 14}, {"kind": "final", "text": "assustada, e ela era só...", "t_start": 43.10000000000001, "t_end": 44.38, "t_avail": 44.400000000000006, "ends_turn": true, "utt": 14}, {"kind": "partial", "text": "Eu não quero", "t_start": 44.400000000000006, "t_end": 45.14000000000001, "t_avail": 45.800000000000004, "ends_turn": false, "utt": 15}, {"kind": "silence", "text": "<|no voice|>", "t_start": 46.6, "t_end": 46.6, "t_avail": 46.6, "ends_turn": false, "utt": 0}, {"kind": "final", "text": "quero. Sei se eles amam.", "t_start": 44.940000000000005, "t_end": 46.02, "t_avail": 46.800000000000004, "ends_turn": true, "utt": 15}, {"kind": "partial", "text": "por causa do", "t_start": 46.800000000000004, "t_end": 47.300000000000004, "t_avail": 49.400000000000006, "ends_turn": false, "utt": 16}, {"kind": "silence", "text": "<|no voice|>", "t_start": 49.800000000000004, "t_end": 49.800000000000004, "t_avail": 49.800000000000004, "ends_turn": false, "utt": 0}, {"kind": "final", "text": "já estava de pular e não podíamos", "t_start": 47.82000000000001, "t_end": 48.84, "t_avail": 50.0, "ends_turn": false, "utt": 16}, {"kind": "final", "text": "voltar.", "t_start": 48.84, "t_end": 49.1, "t_avail": 50.0, "ends_turn": true, "utt": 16}, {"kind": "final", "text": "Alô, esse é o f...", "t_start": 50.56, "t_end": 51.38, "t_avail": 51.400000000000006, "ends_turn": true, "utt": 17}, {"kind": "partial", "text": "que fez tipo pizza, depois francês e", "t_start": 51.400000000000006, "t_end": 53.52, "t_avail": 54.800000000000004, "ends_turn": false, "utt": 18}, {"kind": "partial", "text": "a", "t_start": 53.540000000000006, "t_end": 53.620000000000005, "t_avail": 55.400000000000006, "ends_turn": false, "utt": 18}, {"kind": "silence", "text": "<|no voice|>", "t_start": 55.6, "t_end": 55.6, "t_avail": 55.6, "ends_turn": false, "utt": 0}, {"kind": "final", "text": "linha literalmente paralela.", "t_start": 53.620000000000005, "t_end": 55.06, "t_avail": 55.800000000000004, "ends_turn": true, "utt": 18}, {"kind": "final", "text": "Ela nem pente por...", "t_start": 55.800000000000004, "t_end": 57.18000000000001, "t_avail": 57.2, "ends_turn": true, "utt": 19}, {"kind": "final", "text": "Eu não vou. Eu não vou.", "t_start": 57.2, "t_end": 58.18, "t_avail": 58.2, "ends_turn": true, "utt": 20}, {"kind": "partial", "text": "levemente", "t_start": 58.2, "t_end": 58.74, "t_avail": 59.400000000000006, "ends_turn": false, "utt": 21}, {"kind": "partial", "text": "diagonal.", "t_start": 58.760000000000005, "t_end": 59.46, "t_avail": 60.2, "ends_turn": false, "utt": 21}, {"kind": "silence", "text": "<|no voice|>", "t_start": 61.2, "t_end": 61.2, "t_avail": 61.2, "ends_turn": false, "utt": 0}, {"kind": "final", "text": "ela só tipo deslava aí.", "t_start": 59.720000000000006, "t_end": 60.760000000000005, "t_avail": 61.400000000000006, "ends_turn": true, "utt": 21}, {"kind": "silence", "text": "<|no voice|>", "t_start": 62.0, "t_end": 62.0, "t_avail": 62.0, "ends_turn": false, "utt": 0}], "user_speech_spans": [[1.9, 4.9], [5.1, 6.1], [7.1, 9.3], [9.5, 9.9], [10.4, 10.9], [12.3, 12.7], [13.1, 14.5], [14.9, 19.8], [20.1, 20.6], [20.8, 27.6], [28.3, 31.4], [31.6, 32.0], [32.1, 32.9], [33.1, 34.4], [35.3, 36.7], [39.2, 41.8], [42.1, 46.1], [47.0, 49.3], [50.3, 50.7], [50.9, 55.1], [56.1, 56.6], [56.8, 57.5], [57.8, 60.8]], "decisions": [{"kind": "partial", "t": 3.2, "piece": "A gente não conseguia ver", "ends_turn": false, "tag": "user_is_speaking", "text": "", "compute_s": 0.057}, {"kind": "partial", "t": 3.8, "piece": "pra onde", "ends_turn": false, "tag": "user_is_speaking", "text": "", "compute_s": 0.057}, {"kind": "partial", "t": 5.2, "piece": "a encosta continuava, tipo ela só", "ends_turn": false, "tag": "user_is_speaking", "text": "", "compute_s": 0.057}, {"kind": "final", "t": 5.6, "piece": "ia ir e era tipo...", "ends_turn": true, "tag": "user_is_speaking", "text": "", "compute_s": 0.057}, {"kind": "silence", "t": 6.6, "piece": "<|no voice|>", "ends_turn": false, "tag": "user_is_speaking", "text": "", "compute_s": 0.056}, {"kind": "final", "t": 6.8, "piece": "Fora! Oh!", "ends_turn": true, "tag": "user_is_speaking", "text": "", "compute_s": 0.058}, {"kind": "partial", "t": 8.2, "piece": "Finalmente a gente", "ends_turn": false, "tag": "user_is_speaking", "text": "", "compute_s": 0.059}, {"kind": "partial", "t": 9.0, "piece": "chegou e a gente", "ends_turn": false, "tag": "user_is_speaking", "text": "", "compute_s": 0.058}, {"kind": "partial", "t": 9.6, "piece": "tava com esses amigos", "ends_turn": false, "tag": "user_is_speaking", "text": "", "compute_s": 0.059}, {"kind": "partial", "t": 10.4, "piece": "que...", "ends_turn": false, "tag": "user_is_speaking", "text": "", "compute_s": 0.057}, {"kind": "final", "t": 10.6, "piece": "Chegou. Por um...", "ends_turn": true, "tag": "user_is_speaking", "text": "", "compute_s": 0.058}, {"kind": "silence", "t": 11.4, "piece": "<|no voice|>", "ends_turn": false, "tag": "user_is_speaking", "text": "", "compute_s": 0.061}, {"kind": "final", "t": 11.6, "piece": "tempo.", "ends_turn": true, "tag": "user_finish_speaking", "text": "Ah, entendeu! Ficamos perdidos na encosta, não sabíamos onde ela terminava... E quando finalmente chegamos, foi só um momento com os amigos — tipo, \"finalmente ", "compute_s": 1.144}, {"kind": "silence", "t": 12.2, "piece": "<|no voice|>", "ends_turn": false, "tag": "user_is_speaking", "text": "", "compute_s": 0.059}, {"kind": "final", "t": 13.4, "piece": "tipo eles", "ends_turn": true, "tag": "user_is_speaking", "text": "", "compute_s": 0.059}, {"kind": "partial", "t": 15.0, "piece": "que é atrás de nós.", "ends_turn": false, "tag": "user_finish_speaking", "text": "Ah, tá! Eles estavam atrás de nós todo o tempo... Finalmente chegamos, mas a gente só percebeu depois. 😅<|im_end|>", "compute_s": 0.996}, {"kind": "final", "t": 15.2, "piece": "mas...", "ends_turn": true, "tag": "user_is_speaking", "text": "", "compute_s": 0.065}, {"kind": "partial", "t": 17.4, "piece": "o pai deles levava eles tipo todo.", "ends_turn": false, "tag": "user_finish_speaking", "text": "Tá... e o pai deles levava eles todo o tempo. Tipo, sempre atrás, sempre no mesmo lugar. 😅<|im_end|>", "compute_s": 0.955}, {"kind": "partial", "t": 18.2, "piece": "20 semanas", "ends_turn": false, "tag": "user_is_speaking", "text": "", "compute_s": 0.064}, {"kind": "partial", "t": 19.4, "piece": "as vezes eles ficaram tipo muito envolvidos", "ends_turn": false, "tag": "user_is_speaking", "text": "", "compute_s": 0.067}, {"kind": "partial", "t": 19.4, "piece": "com isso", "ends_turn": false, "tag": "user_is_speaking", "text": "", "compute_s": 0.059}, {"kind": "partial", "t": 20.2, "piece": "e também", "ends_turn": false, "tag": "user_is_speaking", "text": "", "compute_s": 0.06}, {"kind": "final", "t": 20.4, "piece": "foi.", "ends_turn": true, "tag": "user_finish_speaking", "text": "20 semanas... e eles ficaram muito envolvidos, como se fosse uma rotina. Tipo, sempre lá, sempre no mesmo ritmo. 😅<|im_end|>", "compute_s": 1.015}, {"kind": "final", "t": 21.2, "piece": "", "ends_turn": true, "tag": "no_tag", "text": "", "compute_s": 0.06}, {"kind": "partial", "t": 23.2, "piece": "e começar a esquiar, foi o ano", "ends_turn": false, "tag": "user_is_speaking", "text": "", "compute_s": 0.061}, {"kind": "partial", "t": 23.2, "piece": "do", "ends_turn": false, "tag": "user_is_speaking", "text": "", "compute_s": 0.061}, {"kind": "partial", "t": 24.6, "piece": "um dos anos dos", "ends_turn": false, "tag": "user_is_speaking", "text": "", "compute_s": 0.065}, {"kind": "partial", "t": 25.2, "piece": "olímpicos de", "ends_turn": false, "tag": "user_is_speaking", "text": "", "compute_s": 0.061}, {"kind": "partial", "t": 26.6, "piece": "de inverno, então eles ficaram tão envolvidos", "ends_turn": false, "tag": "user_is_speaking", "text": "", "compute_s": 0.06}, {"kind": "partial", "t": 27.2, "piece": "com isso.", "ends_turn": false, "tag": "user_finish_speaking", "text": "Tá! Foi o ano dos Olímpicos de Inverno, e aí começou a esquiar — e os amigos ficaram totalmente envolvidos. Tipo, a cada semana era mais forte a conexão", "compute_s": 1.444}, {"kind": "silence", "t": 28.0, "piece": "<|no voice|>", "ends_turn": false, "tag": "user_is_speaking", "text": "", "compute_s": 0.071}, {"kind": "partial", "t": 28.0, "piece": "É por isso.", "ends_turn": false, "tag": "user_finish_speaking", "text": "É por isso que ficou tão marcado. 😊<|im_end|>", "compute_s": 0.905}, {"kind": "final", "t": 28.2, "piece": "eles ficaram.", "ends_turn": true, "tag": "user_finish_speaking", "text": "Eles ficaram... no meio do esquiar, do tempo, do ritmo. 😊<|im_end|>", "compute_s": 0.937}, {"kind": "partial", "t": 31.6, "piece": "Bom de esquiar porque achavam que era", "ends_turn": false, "tag": "user_is_speaking", "text": "", "compute_s": 0.065}, {"kind": "partial", "t": 31.6, "piece": "muito", "ends_turn": false, "tag": "user_is_speaking", "text": "", "compute_s": 0.06}, {"kind": "final", "t": 32.6, "piece": "legal, assim, então tinha.", "ends_turn": true, "tag": "user_finish_speaking", "text": "Bom de esquiar porque achavam que era muito legal — e aí o prazer começou a crescer. 😊<|im_end|>", "compute_s": 1.011}, {"kind": "final", "t": 33.6, "piece": "Tipo? Legal, tipo...", "ends_turn": true, "tag": "user_is_speaking", "text": "", "compute_s": 0.062}, {"kind": "silence", "t": 34.8, "piece": "<|no voice|>", "ends_turn": false, "tag": "user_is_speaking", "text": "", "compute_s": 0.063}, {"kind": "final", "t": 35.0, "piece": "descer.", "ends_turn": true, "tag": "user_finish_speaking", "text": "Tipo: \"Legal, descer, sentir o vento, o gelo, o mundo passar rápido!\" 😄<|im_end|>", "compute_s": 1.003}, {"kind": "partial", "t": 36.8, "piece": "E aí eu", "ends_turn": false, "tag": "user_interruption", "text": "", "compute_s": 0.086}, {"kind": "silence", "t": 37.2, "piece": "<|no voice|>", "ends_turn": false, "tag": "user_is_speaking", "text": "", "compute_s": 0.09}, {"kind": "final", "t": 37.4, "piece": "só era tipo...", "ends_turn": true, "tag": "user_is_speaking", "text": "", "compute_s": 0.09}, {"kind": "silence", "t": 38.0, "piece": "<|no voice|>", "ends_turn": false, "tag": "user_is_speaking", "text": "", "compute_s": 0.098}, {"kind": "silence", "t": 38.6, "piece": "<|no voice|>", "ends_turn": false, "tag": "user_is_speaking", "text": "", "compute_s": 0.09}, {"kind": "partial", "t": 40.4, "piece": "Ok, aí eu", "ends_turn": false, "tag": "user_is_speaking", "text": "", "compute_s": 0.092}, {"kind": "partial", "t": 41.2, "piece": "faço", "ends_turn": false, "tag": "user_is_speaking", "text": "", "compute_s": 0.089}, {"kind": "partial", "t": 41.8, "piece": "e eu era tipo", "ends_turn": false, "tag": "user_is_speaking", "text": "", "compute_s": 0.094}, {"kind": "final", "t": 42.4, "piece": "uau, isso é tão divertido.", "ends_turn": true, "tag": "user_finish_speaking", "text": "E aí eu só era tipo... \"Ok, vou tentar\" — e quando desci, fui: *uau, isso é tão divertido!* 😍<|im_end|>", "compute_s": 1.101}, {"kind": "partial", "t": 43.8, "piece": "Eu estava só muito", "ends_turn": false, "tag": "user_is_speaking", "text": "", "compute_s": 0.094}, {"kind": "final", "t": 44.4, "piece": "assustada, e ela era só...", "ends_turn": true, "tag": "user_is_speaking", "text": "", "compute_s": 0.105}, {"kind": "partial", "t": 45.8, "piece": "Eu não quero", "ends_turn": false, "tag": "user_is_speaking", "text": "", "compute_s": 0.103}, {"kind": "silence", "t": 46.6, "piece": "<|no voice|>", "ends_turn": false, "tag": "user_is_speaking", "text": "", "compute_s": 0.103}, {"kind": "final", "t": 46.8, "piece": "quero. Sei se eles amam.", "ends_turn": true, "tag": "user_finish_speaking", "text": "Tinha medo, sim — mas quando viu que eles amavam, só pensou: \"Eles realmente amam isso. E eu também, só que de forma diferente.\" 😊<|im_end|>", "compute_s": 1.095}, {"kind": "partial", "t": 49.4, "piece": "por causa do", "ends_turn": false, "tag": "user_is_speaking", "text": "", "compute_s": 0.109}, {"kind": "silence", "t": 49.8, "piece": "<|no voice|>", "ends_turn": false, "tag": "user_is_speaking", "text": "", "compute_s": 0.107}, {"kind": "final", "t": 50.0, "piece": "já estava de pular e não podíamos", "ends_turn": false, "tag": "user_is_speaking", "text": "", "compute_s": 0.111}, {"kind": "final", "t": 50.0, "piece": "voltar.", "ends_turn": true, "tag": "user_finish_speaking", "text": "Porque já estava de pular e não podíiamos voltar... Tinha que seguir, mesmo com medo. E foi assim que o momento ficou eterno. 😅<|im_end|>", "compute_s": 1.112}, {"kind": "final", "t": 51.4, "piece": "Alô, esse é o f...", "ends_turn": true, "tag": "user_is_speaking", "text": "", "compute_s": 0.244}, {"kind": "partial", "t": 54.8, "piece": "que fez tipo pizza, depois francês e", "ends_turn": false, "tag": "user_is_speaking", "text": "", "compute_s": 0.254}, {"kind": "partial", "t": 55.4, "piece": "a", "ends_turn": false, "tag": "user_is_speaking", "text": "", "compute_s": 0.245}, {"kind": "silence", "t": 55.6, "piece": "<|no voice|>", "ends_turn": false, "tag": "user_is_speaking", "text": "", "compute_s": 0.544}, {"kind": "final", "t": 55.8, "piece": "linha literalmente paralela.", "ends_turn": true, "tag": "user_finish_speaking", "text": "Alô! Esse foi o fato que fez tipo pizza, depois francês e a linha literalmente paralela... Tudo isso no mesmo dia. 😂🍕🇫🇷<|im_end|>", "compute_s": 1.519}, {"kind": "final", "t": 57.2, "piece": "Ela nem pente por...", "ends_turn": true, "tag": "user_is_speaking", "text": "", "compute_s": 0.477}, {"kind": "final", "t": 58.2, "piece": "Eu não vou. Eu não vou.", "ends_turn": true, "tag": "user_finish_speaking", "text": "Ela nem penteia... Eu não vou. Eu não vou. 😅<|im_end|>", "compute_s": 1.136}, {"kind": "partial", "t": 59.4, "piece": "levemente", "ends_turn": false, "tag": "user_is_speaking", "text": "", "compute_s": 0.494}, {"kind": "partial", "t": 60.2, "piece": "diagonal.", "ends_turn": false, "tag": "user_finish_speaking", "text": "Levemente diagonal... como se o mundo tivesse virado de lado. 😂<|im_end|>", "compute_s": 1.406}, {"kind": "silence", "t": 61.2, "piece": "<|no voice|>", "ends_turn": false, "tag": "user_is_speaking", "text": "", "compute_s": 0.569}, {"kind": "final", "t": 61.4, "piece": "ela só tipo deslava aí.", "ends_turn": true, "tag": "user_finish_speaking", "text": "Ela só deslava... e aí, tudo ficou mais leve. 😊<|im_end|>", "compute_s": 1.507}, {"kind": "silence", "t": 62.0, "piece": "<|no voice|>", "ends_turn": false, "tag": "user_is_speaking", "text": "", "compute_s": 2.152}], "render": {"placed_speech_s": 50.076, "placed_within_input_s": 46.076, "speech_beyond_input_s": 0, "clipped_speech_s": 4.051, "tail_s": 4.0, "turns": 14}}